# --- model weights -----------------------------------------------------------
# Blanket-ignore checkpoints, then re-admit the small ones that ARE this
# project's own output. The 345 MB BEATs backbone is third-party and stays out:
# scripts/fetch_models.py pulls it from the Hugging Face Hub.
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
checkpoints/

# (gitignore has no trailing comments — a '#' on a pattern line is literal)
# trained here, 1.6 MB, the actual result:
!models/ckpt_E10_beats_head.pt
# trained here, documented negative result:
!models/ckpt_E10_stem_recalib.pt
# the 0.650 baseline CNN, 84 KB:
!models/classifier.pt

# --- research artefacts ------------------------------------------------------
# The scripts and JSON results in data/f1_research/ ARE committed (they are the
# "show your work" record). The regenerable multi-hundred-MB blobs are not.
data/f1_research/*.npz
data/f1_research/*.npy
data/f1_research/beats/*.pt
data/f1_research/jamendo/
data/f1_research/shift_other_mels/
data/f1_research/pylibs/
data/f1_research/stem_audio_cache/

